{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要开门了」", "text_idx": 154, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0213", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好好，拜托你了」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欢迎回来。我回来了」", "text_idx": 157, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0214", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我回来了。欢迎回来。\\n　那就先把买回来的东西放进冰箱里吧」", "text_idx": 159, "plain": "「嗯，我回来了。欢迎回来。　那就先把买回来的东西放进冰箱里吧」", "plain_idx": 160, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一起」", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0215", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "去了结女校后，接触各种不同女生的机会变多了，\\n不过，一到放假，我基本上都是和樱乃在一起。", "text_idx": 163, "plain": "去了结女校后，接触各种不同女生的机会变多了，不过，一到放假，我基本上都是和樱乃在一起。", "plain_idx": 164, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是三连休的第二天，我陪她一起去买了东西。", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「放假的期间，哥哥一直在身边，好开心」", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0216", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈。要是隼太有时间，\\n　也许我们就不知道跑哪去玩了」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": "「啊哈哈。要是隼太有时间，　也许我们就不知道跑哪去玩了」", "plain_idx": 169, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果然从临时并校后，隼太同学就很忙呢」", "text_idx": 170, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0217", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没错啊。他那职位也没办法。\\n　所以我也很难叫他出来玩」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": "「没错啊。他那职位也没办法。　所以我也很难叫他出来玩」", "plain_idx": 173, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，不管怎样，\\n　这三天假我原本就打算陪着你的」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": "「不过，不管怎样，　这三天假我原本就打算陪着你的」", "plain_idx": 175, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为什么？」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0218", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「比如便当之类的，我这不一直在麻烦你嘛」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0219", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "当然，这是出于关心，\\n但也不仅限于此。", "text_idx": 181, "plain": "当然，这是出于关心，但也不仅限于此。", "plain_idx": 182, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "适应了结女校的生活后，\\n反而让我再一次深刻地感受到了樱乃的亲近感。", "text_idx": 183, "plain": "适应了结女校的生活后，反而让我再一次深刻地感受到了樱乃的亲近感。", "plain_idx": 184, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就好比吃饭时有味增汤就会开心的感觉一样。", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不禁让我觉得，有一个能够自然相处的人，\\n真是无比珍贵啊。", "text_idx": 186, "plain": "不禁让我觉得，有一个能够自然相处的人，真是无比珍贵啊。", "plain_idx": 187, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以，我也想分担一些事情来表达我的感激之情。", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了，都收拾完了」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果还有要我帮忙的，就告诉我吧」", "text_idx": 190, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「洗好的衣服差不多要干了」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0220", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，那我们一起收起来然后叠好吧」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0221", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且，樱乃也无条件地接纳了，\\n这让我更加地轻松自在。", "text_idx": 196, "plain": "而且，樱乃也无条件地接纳了，这让我更加地轻松自在。", "plain_idx": 197, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她刚刚也说了“哥哥在身边好开心”——\\n而对于我来说，也是完全一样。", "text_idx": 198, "plain": "她刚刚也说了“哥哥在身边好开心”——而对于我来说，也是完全一样。", "plain_idx": 199, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好嘞，走吧～」", "text_idx": 200, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔——」", "text_idx": 201, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0222", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从樱乃的房间走到阳台上，\\n我们先是分头把洗好的衣服收了进来。", "text_idx": 203, "plain": "从樱乃的房间走到阳台上，我们先是分头把洗好的衣服收了进来。", "plain_idx": 204, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "平时大多都是樱乃来我房间，\\n所以我很久没去过樱乃的房间了。", "text_idx": 205, "plain": "平时大多都是樱乃来我房间，所以我很久没去过樱乃的房间了。", "plain_idx": 206, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0223", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没事，我就是在感叹你的房间也很干净」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有这样的哥哥就有这样的妹妹」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0224", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……也是呢」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——在这方面，\\n血缘关系是否存在并不重要。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": "——在这方面，血缘关系是否存在并不重要。", "plain_idx": 214, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "从小到大的共同时光，\\n正是我们成为兄妹的原因。", "text_idx": 215, "plain": "从小到大的共同时光，正是我们成为兄妹的原因。", "plain_idx": 216, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……不过，樱乃之所以这么说，\\n是因为相信我们是亲兄妹吧。", "text_idx": 217, "plain": "……不过，樱乃之所以这么说，是因为相信我们是亲兄妹吧。", "plain_idx": 218, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不愧是我的妹妹」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不愧是哥哥的妹妹」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0225", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，不管怎样，我们肯定是兄妹。", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且我们还特别亲密。\\n也许我们就像彼此的味增汤一样。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": "而且我们还特别亲密。也许我们就像彼此的味增汤一样。", "plain_idx": 224, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有这样的人在身边，果然是件令人开心的事情。", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就叠起来吧」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0226", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好～嘞」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一人一半」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0227", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那这边这座山就拜托你了」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0228", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们亲密地坐在地板上，开始一起叠洗好的衣服。", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「内裤、内裤，哥哥的内裤……」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0229", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……别特意说出来啊」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算是兄妹，\\n听到这种话也还是会感到羞耻啊。", "text_idx": 238, "plain": "就算是兄妹，听到这种话也还是会感到羞耻啊。", "plain_idx": 239, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，平时也都是樱乃帮我叠内裤……", "text_idx": 240, "plain": "不过，平时也都是樱乃帮我叠内裤……", "plain_idx": 240, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看起来很开心呢」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥的内裤，我还挺喜欢的」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0230", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎？」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我好像听到妹妹说了些微妙的发言！", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「又大又蓬松，\\n　感觉能直接戴在头上……我叠我叠」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": "「又大又蓬松，　感觉能直接戴在头上……我叠我叠」", "plain_idx": 247, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0231", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「别别，不要真的戴在头上啊」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃可能真的会做出这种事啊……", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她基本上是个不紧不慢、沉稳冷静的女孩，\\n不过有时却会说出一些离奇的话。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": "她基本上是个不紧不慢、沉稳冷静的女孩，不过有时却会说出一些离奇的话。", "plain_idx": 252, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然不会戴在头上，但我想穿一下」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0232", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃在叠我内裤时，突然将其展开并举了起来。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……与女生的内裤相比，感觉舒服多了」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0233", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真好啊」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0234", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就算你说真好也只会让我困、困扰……！」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我偷偷将目光瞥向衣服堆里洗好的樱乃的内裤。", "text_idx": 261, "plain": "我偷偷将目光瞥向衣服堆里洗好的樱乃的内裤。", "plain_idx": 261, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过……确实，与四角短裤相比，\\n她那种内裤看起来更加贴身，感觉会很挤……", "text_idx": 262, "plain": "不过……确实，与四角短裤相比，她那种内裤看起来更加贴身，感觉会很挤……", "plain_idx": 263, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但、但是，女生那里也没有挂着什么多余的东西，\\n所以紧身些也无所谓吧？", "text_idx": 264, "plain": "但、但是，女生那里也没有挂着什么多余的东西，所以紧身些也无所谓吧？", "plain_idx": 265, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不是，我到底在想什么啊。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好、好啦，别说这个了我们继续叠吧」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「盯——……」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0235", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「果然还是想穿」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0236", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不——行」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「作为交换，哥哥也可以穿我的」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0237", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「男生穿了会勒得不自在的！」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然我觉得问题不是这个，\\n但目前我也只能这么回答了。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": "虽然我觉得问题不是这个，但目前我也只能这么回答了。", "plain_idx": 277, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「无所谓啦」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0238", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可以吗？！」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「给你穿旧的」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0239", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "完全不是那回事啊……", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「条纹内裤或细带内裤，任你选择」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0240", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "还真的找出来了！", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「行了行了，赶紧收起来」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……这样么」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0241", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「条纹内裤勉强还行，但细带内裤还是戴不上啊」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0242", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不穿也不戴！」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「遗憾……我叠，我叠……」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0243", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然嘴上说着遗憾，\\n但樱乃还是不紧不慢地再次开始叠起我的四角短裤。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": "虽然嘴上说着遗憾，但樱乃还是不紧不慢地再次开始叠起我的四角短裤。", "plain_idx": 296, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "真是的，樱乃这样的行为，\\n有时候让我这个哥哥很困扰啊。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": "真是的，樱乃这样的行为，有时候让我这个哥哥很困扰啊。", "plain_idx": 298, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……？」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0244", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃察觉到我的目光，停下了手中的活，抬起头来。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然穿不上，但还是想试穿一下？」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0245", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「才不是才不是」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总觉得和樱乃在一起轻松又自在呢」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和其他女孩子完全不会谈起的话题，\\n和樱乃却聊得毫无拘束。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": "和其他女孩子完全不会谈起的话题，和樱乃却聊得毫无拘束。", "plain_idx": 324, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 2, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "简单来说，\\n樱乃是我在这世界上相处得最轻松自在的女生。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": "简单来说，樱乃是我在这世界上相处得最轻松自在的女生。", "plain_idx": 326, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我再次确认到，她就是我的妹妹。", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 4, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0246", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 5, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不愧是妹妹」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0247", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "樱乃罕见地露出了明朗的笑容，点了点头。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 7, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我呢，是哥哥的空气」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0248", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "能够让我轻松自在地呼吸。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "曾罹患哮喘的我深知，能轻松自在的呼吸，\\n是件多么奢侈的事情——", "text_idx": 335, "plain": "曾罹患哮喘的我深知，能轻松自在的呼吸，是件多么奢侈的事情——", "plain_idx": 336, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……也是呢，以后也请多多关照」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 11, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0249", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 12, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "正因如此，樱乃的比喻显得格外贴切。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比起我刚才联想到的味增汤，\\n她这个比喻更能深深地渗透进我的心中。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": "比起我刚才联想到的味增汤，她这个比喻更能深深地渗透进我的心中。", "plain_idx": 341, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 14, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥也是，多关照我」", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0250", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 15, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，会关照你的」", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 16, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「内裤也给我穿一下」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0251", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你这家伙」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_08.txt", "scene": "*prologue07", "row": 18, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「生气了」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0252", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
